com/godotengine/godot/pull/101583.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"This is an attempt to implement the proposal https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11567\r\n\r\n## Target\r\n\r\n- [x] Expose some functions of RendringDevice to operate semaphore\r\n  - [x] Expose function to create and check semapores\r\n  - [x] Expose function set semapores to compute list\r\n  - [x] Expose function set semapores to draw list\r\n- [x] Solve the potential forever wait problem\r\n- [x] Enable to get semaphore resource native id and set semaphore resource object name on all backends \r\n  - [x] vulkan backend\r\n  - [x] d3d12 backend\r\n  - [ ] metal backend (may not be implemented in this PR)\r\n\r\nFor explicit semaphores on the metal backend, further discussion is needed. The current implementation of the metal backend does not use semaphores (although it is possible to implement this using `MTLFence`). We need to wait until the implementation is completed before allowing the use of explicit semaphores when the driver name is set to metal\r\n\r\n## Simple Test Project\r\n\r\n~~[example_rd_semaphore.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18425355/example_rd_semaphore.zip)~~ (This test case is incorrect because it uses the same wait semaphore multiple times.)\r\n\r\n[example_rd_semaphore.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18451444/example_rd_semaphore.zip)\r\n\r\n[example_rd_semaphore_draw_list.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18450853/example_rd_semaphore_draw_list.zip)\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11567*","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101583/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101583/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}